  "description": "A Native-AOT-compatible Redis integration for CQRSharp: a durable IOutboxStore whose claim, lease and finalize logic runs as atomic Lua scripts (ordered partitions, retries, dead letters), an IInboxStore for effectively-once delivery, and an IIdempotencyStore with token-owned claims, payload fingerprints and result replay.",
  "iconFile": "CQRSharp_Icon.png",
  "id": "CQRSharp.Redis",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-26T01:29:47.383Z",
