  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 244128,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp",
  "published": "2026-09-26T01:26:36.06Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0 (breaking). A new key layout under the {cqrsharp:outbox}: and {cqrs:idemp}: prefixes, and every KeyPrefix must contain a hash tag; drain the outbox with 4.x processors before upgrading.\n            Messages carry a handler name and partition key, claims are leases checked inside the scripts, dead letters can be listed, requeued and purged, and an inbox records deliveries. The idempotency store keeps a claim token, a payload fingerprint and the result.\n            CQRSharp no longer registers an IConnectionMultiplexer: each store runs on the connection it is given (a connection string, an instance or a factory).\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes and the upgrade steps from 4.2.1.",
